  "description": "The META SX V5 ESSENTIAL is centered around FOX Performance and SHIMANO components.\n• The 38 Float Performance fork and Grip cartridge guarantee comfort and reliability and offers three positions. With the large volumes of air and oil, the FOX Float X Performance shock offers consistent operation and maximum Grip. Its MCU stop smoothly handles violent impacts. It is possible to lock it out while pedalling thanks to a dedicated lever.\n• SHIMANO SLX 4-piston brakes with 203mm discs offer a clear feel.\n• The DT SWISS E593 rims and their wide profile are ideal for aggressive riders. Combined with reinforced hubs, they are perfect for the META SX.\n• A SHIMANO SLX 12-speed drivetrain means easy elevation gain.",
